.codegraph/
*.test
*.out
coverage.out

# Brainstorm-mode scratch artifacts. See skills/devdb/SKILL.md "Operating
# modes" — brainstorm docs are not anchored to a plan and should either
# be promoted to execution mode (committed) or stay out of git entirely.
docs/*-brainstorm.md
docs/brainstorm-*.md

# Hermes plan artifacts (repo-local, not part of the product)
.hermes/
__pycache__/

# Built binaries. `go build ./cmd/devdb` and ./cmd/devdb-openclaw land here when
# someone builds from the repo root instead of `go install`, and the doc-verb
# lint's regression tests build both — keep them out of git status.
/devdb
/devdb-openclaw
